WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.443
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> Stirling Castle is one of Scotland’s top ten tourist attractions.

2
00:00:11.768 --> 00:00:14.835
Parts of it are over 600 years old.

3
00:00:15.351 --> 00:00:18.669
It was once the home of Scottish kings and queens.

4
00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:21.456
Later, soldiers lived there.

5
00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:26.219
Every year, the castle receives about half a million visitors.

6
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:29.773
Some people say the castle has a ghost!